date] {:db/id "17592186511507-III-true" :answer/id #uuid "650d99fb-d04d-535c-8b8e-327b68d7522e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186511507-III-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186511507-III" :answer-field/id #uuid "4339894d-b06d-5035-aafe-f193e2a6cc8d" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186511507-III-false" "17592186511507-III-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186511507-III-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186511507-III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186511507 :question/answer-fields "17592186511507-III"] [:db/retract 17592186511507 :question/answer-fields 17592186511391] [:db/cas 17592186511507 :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nII. ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nIII. The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [:db/cas 17592186511507 :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =-3\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12+0+2 \\\\ 3+6+4 \\\\ 0+0+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =-3\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12+0+2 \\\\ 3+6+4 \\\\ 0+0+10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNotice that we can reorder the equations in this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ 5{x}_{3} &=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system using back substitution, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."] [:db/ensure 17592186511507 :question/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-I-false" :answer/id #uuid "ae6672d7-cb8d-55c7-9e22-934f78536932" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-I-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-I-true" :answer/id #uuid "47e213ed-ce8f-5b35-b7f7-22ff4b6cf322" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-I-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-I" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b1f1a17-f1fe-56b4-a815-029ac23b9c83" :answer-field/key "$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186564502-I-false" "17592186564502-I-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186564502-I-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-I" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186564502 :question/answer-fields "17592186564502-I"] {:db/id "17592186564502-II-false" :answer/id #uuid "56e932a1-8103-5f1a-b2de-3f3fdf88deb1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-II-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-II-true" :answer/id #uuid "d2f38d04-2b33-5450-9f1b-c007c584badc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-II-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-II" :answer-field/id #uuid "1bb6e731-b390-54b7-83a3-519a5fa30109" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186564502-II-false" "17592186564502-II-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186564502-II-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-II" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186564502 :question/answer-fields "17592186564502-II"] {:db/id "17592186564502-III-false" :answer/id #uuid "32a621de-dd0f-53e7-b651-3a1d9b589b7b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-III-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-III-true" :answer/id #uuid "d3e412c8-c9a2-54ac-a063-aff9bb8c2290" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-III-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186564502-III" :answer-field/id #uuid "f2525ba9-478e-5c95-a4c2-ab161c046ae5" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186564502-III-false" "17592186564502-III-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186564502-III-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186564502-III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186564502 :question/answer-fields "17592186564502-III"] [:db/retract 17592186564502 :question/answer-fields 17592186564452] [:db/cas 17592186564502 :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nII. ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nIII. The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent." "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [:db/cas 17592186564502 :question/worked-solution "We say that two vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}=2{x}_{2}.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" "We say that two vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-2{\\mathbf{a}}_{2} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}8 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne \\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. The equation ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2} &=\\mathbf{0}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSolving this system, we find that the solution is ${x}_{1}=2{x}_{2}.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}\\}$ is linearly dependent.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."] [:db/ensure 17592186564502 :question/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-I-false" :answer/id #uuid "e12ce938-55fd-5b8e-aa74-ad38e2d79e2e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-I-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-I-true" :answer/id #uuid "7ed54190-1a5b-5f2b-a389-f80e70eece0f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-I-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-I" :answer-field/id #uuid "25efb205-ad57-5f7d-a185-76e284bc0771" :answer-field/key "$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186572667-I-false" "17592186572667-I-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186572667-I-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-I" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186572667 :question/answer-fields "17592186572667-I"] {:db/id "17592186572667-II-false" :answer/id #uuid "c4583430-7c83-5bbb-8212-9645191e54de" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-II-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-II-true" :answer/id #uuid "6f74b06d-f41f-56f2-abbf-5c1270ea7000" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-II-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-II" :answer-field/id #uuid "c540af96-b65d-533e-8bcc-adb51155b8b4" :answer-field/key "${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186572667-II-false" "17592186572667-II-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186572667-II-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-II" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186572667 :question/answer-fields "17592186572667-II"] {:db/id "17592186572667-III-false" :answer/id #uuid "92d039cb-e0f9-5c47-976d-fde354577f81" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-III-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-III-true" :answer/id #uuid "15fd28e5-e940-5e58-87d2-54f1fadeb58a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-III-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186572667-III" :answer-field/id #uuid "175ece7b-0760-53fc-aea7-2590bee64ca0" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186572667-III-false" "17592186572667-III-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186572667-III-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186572667-III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186572667 :question/answer-fields "17592186572667-III"] [:db/retract 17592186572667 :question/answer-fields 17592186572601] [:db/cas 17592186572667 :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nII. ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$\n\nIII. The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [:db/cas 17592186572667 :question/worked-solution "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -14 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-4-2 \\\\ 9+5-14 \\\\ -3+3+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. Since statement I is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}=3,\\,{x}_{2}=-1$ and ${x}_{3}=2.$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since statement II is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" "We say that three vectors ${\\mathbf{v}}_{1},{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}$ and ${\\mathbf{v}}_{3}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{\\mathbf{v}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{v}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{v}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nWith that in mind, let's look at each statement in turn.\n\n- The statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true. Indeed:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3} & =3\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -14 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6-4-2 \\\\ 9+5-14 \\\\ -3+3+0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- The statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false. Since the statement “$3{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}-{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+2{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is true, we have ${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ for ${x}_{1}=3,\\,{x}_{2}=-1$ and ${x}_{3}=2.$\n\n- The statement “The set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent.” is true. Since the statement “${x}_{1}{\\mathbf{a}}_{1}+{x}_{2}{\\mathbf{a}}_{2}+{x}_{3}{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}.$” is false, the set $\\{{\\mathbf{a}}_{1},{\\mathbf{a}}_{2},{\\mathbf{a}}_{3}\\}$ is linearly *dependent*.\n\nSelect exactly the statements shown to be true above."] [:db/ensure 17592186572667 :question/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-I-false" :answer/id #uuid "32e8d528-a72d-5d9e-98b4-0499a261e4ad" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-I-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-I-true" :answer/id #uuid "4d0dcae3-97da-5fe2-bef1-f9b81fb5fc85" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-I-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-I" :answer-field/id #uuid "02f60d8a-8f75-5ff1-aef7-9eefd1c007a2" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707061-I-false" "17592186707061-I-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707061-I-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-I" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707061 :question/answer-fields "17592186707061-I"] {:db/id "17592186707061-II-false" :answer/id #uuid "6b8b5a3f-fbb7-5c4d-b6a6-5a672a684655" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-II-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-II-true" :answer/id #uuid "d83a48e2-51fb-5106-9d6f-63b7a45c4690" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-II-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-II" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d5b0b7a-2cca-553b-a387-d33f6bfd3d44" :answer-field/key "$-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707061-II-false" "17592186707061-II-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707061-II-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-II" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707061 :question/answer-fields "17592186707061-II"] {:db/id "17592186707061-III-false" :answer/id #uuid "fddd6e40-99da-523e-8b26-c4e9490daa04" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-III-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-III-true" :answer/id #uuid "6217f12a-3184-558c-80f9-08d4ebfb98ff" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-III-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707061-III" :answer-field/id #uuid "ab73944e-bcd0-579f-8774-2b870ace1c6e" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707061-III-false" "17592186707061-III-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707061-III-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707061-III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707061 :question/answer-fields "17592186707061-III"] [:db/retract 17592186707061 :question/answer-fields 17592186707093] [:db/cas 17592186707061 :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.\n\nII. $-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.\n\nIII. The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [:db/cas 17592186707061 :question/worked-solution "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\ne\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} &=0 \\\\ x_{1}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ -x_{1}+x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nRead a coordinate with just one remaining unknown at each step:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{1}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=0 \\\\ (0)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=0 \\\\ -(0)+x_{2}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery coefficient must be zero. Thus the homogeneous equation has only the trivial solution and the set is **linearly independent**.\n\nA failed candidate alone does not prove independence; the homogeneous-equation argument settles the classification.\n\nStatement I is **true**. Statement II is **false**. Statement III is **true**." "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+4\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\ne\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} &=0 \\\\ x_{1}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ -x_{1}+x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nRead a coordinate with just one remaining unknown at each step:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{1}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=0 \\\\ (0)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=0 \\\\ -(0)+x_{2}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery coefficient must be zero. Thus the homogeneous equation has only the trivial solution and the set is **linearly independent**.\n\nA failed candidate alone does not prove independence; the homogeneous-equation argument settles the classification.\n\nThe statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **true**. The statement “$-2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-4\\mathbf{a}_{2}+4\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **false**. The statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is **true**."] [:db/ensure 17592186707061 :question/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-I-false" :answer/id #uuid "50fcd3b3-bf74-5491-9a55-636eb33e4f08" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-I-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-I-true" :answer/id #uuid "b21b4a4a-e59d-582c-b09b-ddf332f1eef3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-I-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-I" :answer-field/id #uuid "00dc05ed-9711-5c0b-a91e-592954b81093" :answer-field/key "$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707068-I-false" "17592186707068-I-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707068-I-true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-I" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707068 :question/answer-fields "17592186707068-I"] {:db/id "17592186707068-II-false" :answer/id #uuid "6dc54d18-eb51-51b3-b059-db27771a2772" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-II-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-II-true" :answer/id #uuid "af2b969d-20b7-570e-a049-0c10b76d1675" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-II-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-II" :answer-field/id #uuid "cf8022b2-1470-54df-a201-411921520435" :answer-field/key "$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707068-II-false" "17592186707068-II-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707068-II-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-II" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707068 :question/answer-fields "17592186707068-II"] {:db/id "17592186707068-III-false" :answer/id #uuid "c3cd9a48-9a2b-5060-b945-2c6b5f9ac932" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-III-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-III-true" :answer/id #uuid "5a4a3334-c7aa-55c0-ab03-d4eec8a4a558" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-III-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707068-III" :answer-field/id #uuid "e3387586-97b4-569b-a244-784d61a48251" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707068-III-false" "17592186707068-III-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707068-III-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707068-III" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707068 :question/answer-fields "17592186707068-III"] [:db/retract 17592186707068 :question/answer-fields 17592186707102] [:db/cas 17592186707068 :question/problem "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.\n\nII. $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.\n\nIII. The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent." "Consider the following vectors:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked."] [:db/cas 17592186707068 :question/worked-solution "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x_{2}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0 &=0 \\\\ x_{1}-x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nChoose one coefficient nonzero and solve the remaining coordinate equations by substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{2}&=1 \\\\ -2(1)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=2 \\\\ x_{1}-(1)&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives a nontrivial solution. Verify it directly:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nThe coefficients are not all zero, so the set is **linearly dependent**.\n\nStatement I is **true**. Statement II is **false**. Statement III is **false**." "A set is **linearly independent** when the equation $x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ has only the solution $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$. A nontrivial solution proves **linear dependence**.\n\nTest the proposed combination:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ &=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe homogeneous vector equation gives the coordinate system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x_{2}+x_{3} &=0 \\\\ 0 &=0 \\\\ x_{1}-x_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nChoose one coefficient nonzero and solve the remaining coordinate equations by substitution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_{2}&=1 \\\\ -2(1)+x_{3}&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{3}=2 \\\\ x_{1}-(1)&=0\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad x_{1}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives a nontrivial solution. Verify it directly:\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{0}\n$$\n\nThe coefficients are not all zero, so the set is **linearly dependent**.\n\nThe statement “$\\mathbf{a}_{1}+\\mathbf{a}_{2}+2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$.” is **true**. The statement “$x_{1}\\mathbf{a}_{1}+x_{2}\\mathbf{a}_{2}+x_{3}\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$ only if $x_{1}=x_{2}=x_{3}=0$.” is **false**. The statement “The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly independent.” is **false**."] [:db/ensure 17592186707068 :question/validate] {:db/id "17592186707084-I-false" :answer/id #uuid "90824efb-2eb9-5da4-8799-f3cc4ca74971" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-I-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707084-I-true" :answer/id #uuid "4f7f419a-41f8-5607-b3b9-f6256017ac64" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-I-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707084-I" :answer-field/id #uuid "6231bbee-3e57-5bb8-b41a-fa66ae11dbee" :answer-field/key "$2\\mathbf{a}_{1}-2\\mathbf{a}_{2}-2\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\mathbf{0}$." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707084-I-false" "17592186707084-I-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707084-I-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-I" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707084 :question/answer-fields "17592186707084-I"] {:db/id "17592186707084-II-false" :answer/id #uuid "87e31f97-fc5f-5a0e-82d5-b64d097a3dbb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-II-false" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707084-II-true" :answer/id #uuid "51eadb30-84cb-57ed-af25-8bcd5451e220" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-II-true" :answer/validate] {:db/id "17592186707084-II" :answer-field/id #uuid "92e4d01c-9002-5bb9-bc97-4d9b9f1627dc" :answer-field/key "The set $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}, \\mathbf{a}_{2}, \\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is linearly dependent." :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["17592186707084-II-false" "17592186707084-II-true"] :answer-field/correct "17592186707084-II-false"} [:db/ensure "17592186707084-II" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add 17592186707084 :question/answer-fields "17592186707084-II"] {:db/id "17592186707084-III-false" :answer/id #uuid "5f643526-d8cf-56d9-9dac-6c763